      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "20-day IC remained positive across 2020-2022 (0.05845), 2023-2026 (0.03191), 2027-2030 (0.03658), and 2031-2034 (0.02579). Shorter-horizon recent behavior remains weaker, so the factor is admitted only at the 20-session horizon.",
